index 0000000..0a98e8e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/GNOME_PROFESSIONS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Gnome profession equipment (v0.3.80)
+
+- Grower: unchanged base Gnome entity and mesh.
+- Delver: same Gnome mesh and animations, with vanilla Iron Pickaxe in its main hand.
+- Smith: same Gnome mesh and animations, with a new Smith's Hammer item in its main hand.
+- Both use the existing neutral Gnome AI, collective village defense, and 0.8 × 1.0 hitboxes.
+- Client renderer draws the held ItemStack anchored at the animated right-hand pivot. No geometry is added to the Gnome model.
+- Separate Delver and Smith spawn eggs allow testing before village generation is implemented.
+- No profession trades, block work, or village generation are implemented by this change.
